<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-078" chapter-id="c-songshu-078-xiaohuiming-son-of-sihua" source-id="s-songshu-078-xiaohuiming-son-of-sihua-ws2069112">
  <p id="c-songshu-078-xiaohuiming-son-of-sihua:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-078-xiaohuiming-son-of-sihua:p001:m0000" ref="ph1_ms8_hyq_ABA">思話</persName>宗戚令望，蚤見任待，凡歷州十二，杖節監都督九焉。所至雖無皦皦清節，亦無穢黷之累。愛才好士，人多歸之。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-078-xiaohuiming-son-of-sihua:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">次子<persName id="c-songshu-078-xiaohuiming-son-of-sihua:p002:m0002" ref="ph1_ms8_hyq_ABAB">惠明</persName>，亦有世譽，歷黃門郎，御史中丞，司徒左長史，吳興太守。</p>
</text>
